data: {"id": "2ca772116c70484c-final", "run_id": "2ca772116c70484c", "seq": 2669, "ts_ms": 1788425173693, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2 的容器 spec 引用了 Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input 中不存在的 key 'unavailable-key'，导致 kubelet 无法注入配置，触发 CreateContainerConfigError 阻止容器启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 直接定位挂载失败的具体原因及缺失键名 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_message: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 辅助确认容器因配置注入失败而等待 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: CreateContainerConfigError` | 明确失败阶段与根本机制 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"} = 1` | 独立验证容器处于配置错误等待状态 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` | 描述 Pod 当前处于等待调度完成的状态 |\n\n**证据链印证说明**：\nKubernetes 事件 (1) 提供了故障的具体上下文（缺少 Secret Key），这直接解释了 K8s State (3) 中 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态的来源。Metric (4) 从监控层独立确认了这一特定的等待原因，两者指向一致。由于容器未能成功启动，Logging 和 Tracing 维度缺失是物理限制，不影响上述判断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nSecret aiops-case-04/workload-input 中不存在 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 无法注入容器配置 → 容器状态转为 CreateContainerConfigError → Pod 停留在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 的容器 spec 引用了不存在的 Secret 键 `unavailable-key`。Kubernetes 事件 (1, #1) 和容器状态信息 (2, #2) 共同证实了这一配置错误，导致 kubelet 在启动容器时因无法解析配置而直接抛出 `CreateContainerConfigError` 错误，从而阻塞了容器启动过程。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 73.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 73.6s (Evidence 67.6s, RCA 5.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 98.654, "metrics": {"run_id": "2ca772116c70484c", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 98.65930771827698, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 98659.30771827698, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 91206.43639564514, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 17, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 16490.246295928955, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6837.444543838501}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17553.42340